{"repositoryId":1229891641,"availability":"available","full":"xandermeyen/Escape-room","name":"Escape-room","description":"Browser-based escape rooms for 2 to 4 players, played together in real time from your own screens. Two experiences live: Kamer 14 and D.U.A. Built with TypeScript, Vite and Firebase.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-05-05T13:33:42Z","updated":"2026-10-17T20:11:34Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://bureau-x.be/","topics":["bootstrap","dutch","escape-room","firebase","github-pages","multiplayer","online-game","realtime-database","two-player-game","vite"],"demo":"https://bureau-x.be/experiences/kamer-14/?sessie=DEMO-K14","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T22:40:55.724Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T22:40:55.724Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T22:40:55.724Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-17T22:40:55.724Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Online escape rooms voor twee tot vier spelers, elk op hun eigen scherm.","Bureau X is een online escape room die je met z'n tweeën (of met vier) speelt, terwijl je met elkaar belt. Elke speler krijgt een ander dossier en ziet dus andere stukken van het verhaal. Geen enkele puzzel los je alleen op: je moet voorlezen, vergelijken en overleggen.","Ik bouwde dit naast mijn opleiding Graduaat Programmeren. Het draait live op bureau-x.be en wordt gespeeld door echte groepen, die via een boekingsformulier een sessiecode krijgen."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/xandermeyen/Escape-room/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"f0cbf624e9b392f5e42e482e20aa16e0fc24da457c732d776f949fd66cd833da","extractedAt":"2026-10-17T22:40:55.843Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T22:40:55.843Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Online escape rooms voor twee tot vier spelers, elk op hun eigen scherm.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/xandermeyen/Escape-room/blob/main/READ